Problem in one line:
“Releasing software is risky, slow, and unpredictable.”
________________________________________
2️⃣ Desired Outcome (What success looks like)
When this project is complete:
•	Releases are repeatable and predictable
•	Environments behave consistently
•	Failures are detected early
•	Rollback is fast and safe
•	Teams deploy with confidence
