🧱 High-Level Architecture (Simple Words)
Think of this system like a factory:
1.	Ideas are recorded
2.	Quality is checked
3.	Product is packaged
4.	Factory space is prepared
5.	Product is run safely
6.	Everything is monitored
Each step has one clear owner.
________________________________________
🔁 Logical Flow (Very Important)
Change → Validate → Package → Prepare → Run → Observe → Improve
This flow is the heart of DevOps.
